Down-to-earth working style
Good team player
Highly self-motivated and directed.
Good written, oral, and interpersonal communication skills.
Able to work with different cultures and communicate with international teams.
Fluent in English is a big plus due to the need to communicate with English-speaking counterparts

Compensation & Benefits
Competitive compensation package
Salary plus options
Healthcare benefits"
